{"type":"message","id":"77b2fdc6","parentId":"d6263f55","timestamp":"2026-05-24T21:35:32.923Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101. The error \"1101\" seems to be a custom error from the platform. Let me try to understand what this error means - perhaps the message format has changed, or there's something specific expected.\n\nLet me check the /history endpoint more thoroughly to see if there's a clue about the expected format. Since /history works and /send doesn't, maybe there's a validation issue. The error code 1101 appears to be coming from the platform itself.\n\nLet me try a very simple message format.\n","thinkingSignature":"703c94498be4fc6f96cd9907dedf206c21268de77fffb9068772c1c9a101b05b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ayuki05bgysg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check the /send endpoint via GET first to understand expected format\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":273,"output":192,"cacheRead":23936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779658528886,"responseId":"0662a2219f4498b40bc78351a99caeb0"}}
